==English==

===Etymology===
Probably from {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|taiaut||lang=fr}}, a deer-hunting cry.

===Interjection===
{{en-intj}}

#{{UK}} used to [[urge]] on a [[fox hunt]], especially when the [[fox]] is [[sight]]ed.
#:''There he is! Coming out of that coppice! '''Tallyho tallyho tallyho'''!''

